# Keys are pasted in the in-app Settings drawer.
# The Vite proxy must not read GROQ_API_KEY or OMNIROUTE_API_KEY.
#
# OMNIROUTE_MODEL is the model id for the app (Vite inlines it at dev/build)
# and for live tests. It is not a secret. Settings has no model picker.
#
# Live tests (`npm run test:live`) require these in the test-runner env:
#   GROQ_API_KEY
#   OMNIROUTE_API_KEY
#   OMNIROUTE_MODEL        # OmniRoute provider/model id
#   OMNIROUTE_URL          # optional; default http://localhost:20128
#                          # server root only — do not append /v1 or /v1/models
